{"seq":3,"slug":"bcd-gray-code","title":"BCD 码与格雷码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/number-systems/bcd-gray-code","wordCount":1371,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"bcd-码与格雷码\">BCD 码与格雷码</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>BCD（Binary-Coded Decimal）码和格雷码（Gray Code）是两种针对特定工程需求设计的编码方式。BCD 码保留十进制数的逐位对应关系，便于人机交互显示；格雷码确保相邻编码值仅有一位变化，用于消除机械编码器和异步信号传输中的毛刺问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[特殊编码体系] --&gt; B[BCD码]&#10;    A --&gt; C[格雷码]&#10;    B --&gt; D[8421 BCD]&#10;    B --&gt; E[余3码]&#10;    B --&gt; F[2421码]&#10;    C --&gt; G[标准格雷码]&#10;    C --&gt; H[平衡格雷码]&#10;    D --&gt; I[七段显示/计算器]&#10;    G --&gt; J[旋转编码器/ADC]\">graph TD\n    A[特殊编码体系] --&gt; B[BCD码]\n    A --&gt; C[格雷码]\n    B --&gt; D[8421 BCD]\n    B --&gt; E[余3码]\n    B --&gt; F[2421码]\n    C --&gt; G[标准格雷码]\n    C --&gt; H[平衡格雷码]\n    D --&gt; I[七段显示/计算器]\n    G --&gt; J[旋转编码器/ADC]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编码类型</th>\n<th>核心特征</th>\n<th>主要优势</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>8421 BCD</td>\n<td>每位十进制用 4 位二进制表示</td>\n<td>十进制转换直观</td>\n<td>数字显示、金融计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>余 3 码</td>\n<td>BCD + 3，自补特性</td>\n<td>简化减法运算</td>\n<td>算术运算电路</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准格雷码</td>\n<td>相邻码距为 1</td>\n<td>消除多位同时翻转</td>\n<td>编码器、CDC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位距离码</td>\n<td>循环码，首尾相邻</td>\n<td>循环编码无跳变</td>\n<td>旋转位置检测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"bcd-编码详解\">BCD 编码详解</h2><h3 id=\"8421-bcd-码\">8421 BCD 码</h3><p>8421 BCD 是最常用的十进制编码，每个十进制数字独立编码为 4 位二进制，权重分别为 8、4、2、1：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>十进制</th>\n<th>BCD 编码</th>\n<th>十进制</th>\n<th>BCD 编码</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0000</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>0101</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0001</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>0110</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0010</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>0111</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>0011</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>1000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>0100</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>1001</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1010</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1010</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1010</span></span></span></span></span> ~ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1111</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1111</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1111</span></span></span></span></span> 共 6 个组合在 BCD 中为非法码（invalid codes）。</p>\n<p>多位十进制数的 BCD 表示：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>259</mn><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>10</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0010</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mn>0101</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><msub><mn>1001</mn><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(259)_{10} = 0010\\_0101\\_1001_{BCD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">259</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9544em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0010_0101_100</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<h3 id=\"bcd-加法与修正\">BCD 加法与修正</h3><p>两个 BCD 数相加时，若本位结果超过 9 或产生进位，需加 6 修正：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0101</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1101</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5 + 8 = 0101 + 1000 = 1101</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0101</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1101</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1101</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1101 &gt; 1001</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1101</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1001</span></span></span></span></span>，加 6 修正：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1101</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0110</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mn>0011</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1101 + 0110 = 1\\_0011</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1101</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0110</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9544em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1_0011</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>结果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0001</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><msub><mn>0011</mn><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mn>13</mn><mn>10</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0001\\_0011_{BCD} = 13_{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9544em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0001_001</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，正确。</p>\n<p>修正条件（产生加 6）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>结果大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1001</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1001</span></span></span></span></span>（即出现非法码 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1010</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1010</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1010</span></span></span></span></span> ~ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1111</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1111</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1111</span></span></span></span></span>）</li>\n<li>该位产生了进位</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"余-3-码\">余 3 码</h3><p>余 3 码（Excess-3）是在 8421 BCD 基础上每位加 3 得到：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>余3码</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>BCD</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>0011</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{余3码} = \\text{BCD} + 0011</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">余</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">码</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BCD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0011</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>余 3 码的核心优势是<strong>自补特性</strong>：对一个余 3 码取反（每位取补），得到的恰好是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9-N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的余 3 码。这使得减法可以通过取补加法实现，无需额外修正电路。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>十进制</th>\n<th>余 3 码</th>\n<th>取反</th>\n<th>对应十进制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>0110</td>\n<td>1001</td>\n<td>6 (9-3)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>1010</td>\n<td>0101</td>\n<td>2 (9-7)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"格雷码原理\">格雷码原理</h2><h3 id=\"编码规则\">编码规则</h3><p>格雷码（反射码）具备三个关键性质：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>单位距离性</strong>：任意两个相邻编码之间仅有一位二进制位不同（汉明距离为 1）。</li>\n<li><strong>循环性</strong>：序列首尾两个编码同样只差一位，可首尾相连成环。</li>\n<li><strong>反射性</strong>：后半段编码由前半段镜像翻转并置最高位得到，故又称反射码。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 位标准格雷码的生成规则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_i = B_i \\oplus B_{i+1}, \\quad G_{n-1} = B_{n-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 为自然二进制码，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 为格雷码，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⊕</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oplus</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊕</span></span></span></span></span> 表示异或运算。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>十进制</th>\n<th>二进制</th>\n<th>格雷码</th>\n<th>变化位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>000</td>\n<td>000</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>001</td>\n<td>001</td>\n<td>最低位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>010</td>\n<td>011</td>\n<td>中间位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>011</td>\n<td>010</td>\n<td>最低位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>110</td>\n<td>中间位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>101</td>\n<td>111</td>\n<td>最低位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>110</td>\n<td>101</td>\n<td>中间位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>111</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>最低位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"格雷码与二进制互转\">格雷码与二进制互转</h3><p><strong>二进制转格雷码</strong>：最高位不变，其余各位为相邻两位异或。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>⊕</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G[i] = B[i] \\oplus B[i+1], \\quad i = 0, 1, \\ldots, n-2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span></div><p> </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G[n-1] = B[n-1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>格雷码转二进制</strong>：最高位不变，从高位向低位逐位异或恢复。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B[n-1] = G[n-1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p> </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>⊕</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B[i] = B[i+1] \\oplus G[i], \\quad i = n-2, n-3, \\ldots, 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 二进制转格雷码&#10;        B3[B3] --&gt; G3[G3=B3]&#10;        B3 --&gt; X1[XOR]&#10;        B2[B2] --&gt; X1&#10;        X1 --&gt; G2[G2]&#10;        B2 --&gt; X2[XOR]&#10;        B1[B1] --&gt; X2&#10;        X2 --&gt; G1[G1]&#10;        B1 --&gt; X3[XOR]&#10;        B0[B0] --&gt; X3&#10;        X3 --&gt; G0[G0]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 二进制转格雷码\n        B3[B3] --&gt; G3[G3=B3]\n        B3 --&gt; X1[XOR]\n        B2[B2] --&gt; X1\n        X1 --&gt; G2[G2]\n        B2 --&gt; X2[XOR]\n        B1[B1] --&gt; X2\n        X2 --&gt; G1[G1]\n        B1 --&gt; X3[XOR]\n        B0[B0] --&gt; X3\n        X3 --&gt; G0[G0]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"格雷码的工程应用\">格雷码的工程应用</h2><h3 id=\"旋转编码器\">旋转编码器</h3><p>机械旋转编码器中，码盘的多个光电传感器不可能在同一瞬间精确切换。若使用自然二进制编码，从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>011</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">011</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">011</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 的跳变可能产生 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">001</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">001</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>110</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">110</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">110</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>111</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">111</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">111</span></span></span></span></span> 等中间错误值。格雷码确保相邻位置仅一位变化，即使读取时刻有微小偏差，结果要么是当前值要么是相邻值，不会出现大幅度跳变。</p>\n<h3 id=\"异步-fifo-的跨时钟域指针\">异步 FIFO 的跨时钟域指针</h3><p>在异步 FIFO 设计中，读写指针需要跨越时钟域传递。由于亚稳态问题，多位信号同时跳变可能导致错误采样。将指针编码为格雷码后：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>自然二进制风险</th>\n<th>格雷码优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>指针递增</td>\n<td>可能多位同时翻转</td>\n<td>仅一位翻转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨时钟域采样</td>\n<td>可能采到错误中间值</td>\n<td>最多偏差一个位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空满判断</td>\n<td>需要精确比较</td>\n<td>安全的保守判断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"卡诺图中的坐标编码\">卡诺图中的坐标编码</h3><p>卡诺图（K-Map）的行列标号使用格雷码排列，确保逻辑上相邻的最小项在图中也物理相邻，便于识别可合并的项组。</p>\n<h2 id=\"其他工程编码\">其他工程编码</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编码</th>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>独热码 (One-Hot)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 位中仅 1 位为 1</td>\n<td>译码简单，检错容易</td>\n<td>FPGA 状态机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>约翰逊码</td>\n<td>移位计数器输出</td>\n<td>相邻码距 1，环形</td>\n<td>定序器、分频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奇偶校验码</td>\n<td>数据+1位校验</td>\n<td>检测单位错误</td>\n<td>存储器、通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海明码</td>\n<td>数据+多位校验</td>\n<td>单位纠错、双位检错</td>\n<td>ECC 内存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>BCD 码在人机交互和金融精确计算场景中不可替代，其加法修正逻辑是组合电路设计的经典案例。格雷码通过单位距离特性解决了机械编码器的多位跳变问题和数字系统中跨时钟域的安全传输问题。理解这些特殊编码的设计动机和数学性质，有助于在实际工程中选择最适合的数据表示方案，在可靠性、面积和速度之间取得平衡。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"BCD 码与格雷码","id":"bcd-码与格雷码"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"BCD 编码详解","id":"bcd-编码详解"},{"level":3,"text":"8421 BCD 码","id":"8421-bcd-码"},{"level":3,"text":"BCD 加法与修正","id":"bcd-加法与修正"},{"level":3,"text":"余 3 码","id":"余-3-码"},{"level":2,"text":"格雷码原理","id":"格雷码原理"},{"level":3,"text":"编码规则","id":"编码规则"},{"level":3,"text":"格雷码与二进制互转","id":"格雷码与二进制互转"},{"level":2,"text":"格雷码的工程应用","id":"格雷码的工程应用"},{"level":3,"text":"旋转编码器","id":"旋转编码器"},{"level":3,"text":"异步 FIFO 的跨时钟域指针","id":"异步-fifo-的跨时钟域指针"},{"level":3,"text":"卡诺图中的坐标编码","id":"卡诺图中的坐标编码"},{"level":2,"text":"其他工程编码","id":"其他工程编码"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"补码与浮点数表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/number-systems/twos-complement-floating-point"},"next":{"title":"布尔代数与逻辑化简","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/digital-electronics/combinational-logic/boolean-algebra-simplification"}}